sequenceDiagram
    participant Panel as Home Panel
    participant Core as Home Core
    participant Service as Service rappels/tâches
    participant DB as SQLite local
    participant Jarvis as Assistant vocal
    Panel->>Core: GET/PATCH rappels ou tâches
    Jarvis->>Core: commande vocale transcrite
    Core->>Service: cas d'usage
    Service->>DB: lecture/écriture persistante
    DB-->>Service: état durable
    Service-->>Core: résultat
    Core-->>Panel: état confirmé
